WaviTrack

This distribution includes a modified ESP32-DW3000 library derived from the
Makerfabs ESP32 UWB DW3000 project:
https://github.com/Makerfabs/Makerfabs-ESP32-UWB-DW3000

The Makerfabs project credits NConcepts as the library developer; the included
library metadata credits Yannick SILVA as author and maintainer. Source files
also contain Decawave copyright notices. The upstream package metadata declares
Apache-2.0. Existing copyright and attribution notices are retained.

WaviTrack changes to the library include ESP32 SPI block transfers for CIR
access, runtime SPI-clock selection, and ESP32 port, UART, and interrupt/mutex
adaptations. The distributed library examples also have pin and SPI settings
changed from the Makerfabs version. Board-specific WaviTrack sketches are in
firmware/v2 and firmware/v3.

The Seeed Studio XIAO Series KiCad library in
hardware/v3/Seeed Studio XIAO Series Library is from Seeed Studio's
OPL_Kicad_Library project:
https://github.com/Seeed-Studio/OPL_Kicad_Library
It is licensed under Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International
(CC BY-SA 4.0). See the license note in that directory. Its XIAO ESP32-C6 SMD
footprint is also copied unchanged to hardware/v3/WaviTrack.pretty. The copy
in hardware/v3/Xiao.pretty has a renamed footprint and KiCad-format updates.

Other third-party component models in hardware/v3 are not claimed as
WaviTrack-authored material.
